@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.iuml
title Intermediate model - policy, classification, and history
top to bottom direction
class "Organization Policy" as Policy
class "Downloads Folder" as Folder
class "Category Rule" as Rule
class Category
class "Downloaded File" as File
class "Review Area" as Review
class Operation
Policy "0..1" -- "1" Folder : selects
Policy "1" *-- "6" Rule : configures
Rule "1" -- "1" Category : defines treatment for
Folder "1" -- "0..*" File : discovery context of
Folder "1" -- "1" Review : designates
Category "0..1" -- "0..*" File : recorded classification of
File "1" -- "0..*" Operation : subject of
Operation "0..*" --> "0..1" Operation : attempts to undo
note bottom of Category
  Exactly six categories in the MVP.
  One current rule per category.
  A tracked file has one category;
  an untracked candidate may have none.
end note
note bottom of Folder
  One configured policy selects one folder.
  Earlier folders can remain in history.
  Discovery context is not current containment.
end note
@enduml
